{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Liars Dice is a bluffing-based roguelike about hidden dice, bold wagers, and outsmarting your opponents through deception and deduction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274940/extras/dice_title.gif?t=1745057551\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Deceive to Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Awaken in a dark forest and face a deadly game of deception against a demon devil. Bluff, guess, and survive\u2014or lose your soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274940/extras/choose_wisley-title.gif?t=1745057551\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274940/extras/colord-dice.gif?t=1745057551\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Roll for Survival</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you roll the dice, every round tests your wits and nerve. The stakes are high, and each decision could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3274940/extras/Test-Gif6.gif?t=1745057551\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Duel of Destiny </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two players, twelve dice, and one dark truth: only one will make it out alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Survive the Shadows</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be the one who survives, or will the darkness claim you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Soul Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3274940/b0bf138c4c33b423d7c85b541c064c3f22544028.jpg"},{"name":"Dicebreaker","path